        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, make allies, build your team, and rise to the top. The Grand Tournament awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite character and dive into a mysterious island full of powerful enemies, thrilling quests, and hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique battle system: Build combo chains from mini attacks turn-based, defend your opponent combos in real-time!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo adventure mode: Become the island’s strongest fighter in a solid 1 hour story-rich single-player experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN multiplayer mode: Challenge your friends over a local network! Look for the multiplayer room receptionist inside Poa Town Market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategic party: Use your favorite allies and your learned attacks and defenses to create the strongest party and defeat everyone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ally any enemy you face and recruit them to your party! Befriend your foes throughout your journey and expand your available roster of fighters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and grind: Level up by battling wild enemies across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide-screen support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports up to 4k screen resolution!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original hand-made art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack: Enjoy a catchy, handcrafted OST throughout your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed entirely by one person.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, make allies, build your team, and rise to the top. The Grand Tournament awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite character and dive into a mysterious island full of powerful enemies, thrilling quests, and hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique battle system: Build combo chains from mini attacks turn-based, defend your opponent combos in real-time!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo adventure mode: Become the island’s strongest fighter in a solid 1 hour story-rich single-player experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN multiplayer mode: Challenge your friends over a local network! Look for the multiplayer room receptionist inside Poa Town Market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategic party: Use your favorite allies and your learned attacks and defenses to create the strongest party and defeat everyone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ally any enemy you face and recruit them to your party! Befriend your foes throughout your journey and expand your available roster of fighters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and grind: Level up by battling wild enemies across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide-screen support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports up to 4k screen resolution!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original hand-made art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack: Enjoy a catchy, handcrafted OST throughout your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed entirely by one person.</p></li></ul>",
